  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1901.06 \"Demonstrator vehicles\" means a new vehicle, with an odometer reading in excess of 2,000 miles, utilized by a dealer.\n\nSource. #8339, eff 4-26-05 (from Saf-C 1902.04); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23 (formerly Saf-C 1901.05)",
